{"id":"n1-045","title":"Noun ともなると","romaji":"〜to mo naru to","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"'When it comes to...', emphasizes a change of situation or status.","longExplanation":"Noun + ともなると indicates a change of state or circumstances once that noun becomes relevant or once one attains that position. It conveys that 'once it’s X, things change' or 'when it comes to X...'.","formation":"Noun + ともなると","examples":[{"jp":"クリスマスともなると、街中がきらきらと輝いて見えます。","romaji":"Kurisumasu to mo naru to, machijuu ga kirakira to kagayaite miemasu.","en":"When it comes to Christmas time, the whole city sparkles.","words":[{"surface":"クリスマス","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なる","vocabId":"1532910","reading":"なる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"街","vocabId":"1204570","reading":"まち"},{"surface":"中","vocabId":"1423310","reading":"ちゅう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"きらきら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"輝いて","vocabId":"1224020","reading":"かがやいて","baseForm":"輝く"},{"surface":"見えます","vocabId":"1259140","reading":"みえます","baseForm":"見える"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,4]},{"jp":"子供が自分の過ちを認めるともなると、話は別ですね。","romaji":"Kodomo ga jibun no ayamachi o mitomeru to mo naru to, hanashi wa betsu desu ne.","en":"When a child admits their mistake, that’s a different story.","words":[{"surface":"子供","vocabId":"1307850","reading":"こども"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"自分","vocabId":"1318610","reading":"じぶん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"過ち","vocabId":"1196010","reading":"あやまち"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"認める","vocabId":"1467530","reading":"みとめる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なる","vocabId":"1532910","reading":"なる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"話は別","vocabId":"2841085","reading":"はなしはべつ"},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ね","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7,8,9,10]},{"jp":"夏休みともなると、海辺は観光客で溢れかえります。","romaji":"Natsu yasumi to mo naru to, umibe wa kankoukyaku de afurekaerimasu.","en":"When summer vacation comes, the seaside is filled with tourists.","words":[{"surface":"夏休み","vocabId":"1191420","reading":"なつやすみ"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なる","vocabId":"1532910","reading":"なる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"海辺","vocabId":"1201750","reading":"うみべ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"観光客","vocabId":"1214870","reading":"かんこうきゃく"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"溢れ","vocabId":"1167610","reading":"あふれ","baseForm":"溢れる"},{"surface":"かえり","vocabId":"1221250","reading":"かえり","baseForm":"かえる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,4]},{"jp":"試験週間ともなると、図書館はいつもより混雑します。","romaji":"Shiken shuukan to mo naru to, toshokan wa itsumo yori konzatsu shimasu.","en":"When exam week arrives, the library gets more crowded than usual.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"週間","vocabId":"1333500","reading":"しゅうかん"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なる","vocabId":"1532910","reading":"なる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"図書館","vocabId":"1370420","reading":"としょかん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いつも","vocabId":"1188890","reading":"いつも"},{"surface":"より","vocabId":"2081070","reading":"より"},{"surface":"混雑","vocabId":"1290390","reading":"こんざつ"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3,4,5]}]}